* Compound interest: what p grows to in n years at r per cent a year.
1.1 Type n, p·(1+r/100)*n in form 1.
Form 1:
after __ years   ______.__
Set p = 1000.
Set r = 5.
Do part 1 for n = 0(5)30.
after  0 years     1000.00
after  5 years     1276.28
after 10 years     1628.89
after 15 years     2078.93
after 20 years     2653.30
after 25 years     3386.35
after 30 years     4321.94
